.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/data/*.csv
**/data/*.duckdb*
**/results/*.png
**/results/*.csv
**/results/*.json
**/results/strategy_dumps/
.pytest_cache/
uv.lock

# Backtest research run artifacts are NOT versioned (2026-10-25 decision):
# the 934-file / 74MB artifact tree is reproducible from the command groups in
# docs/backtest_research.md, so only human-written reports, the run index, the
# universe snapshot and the provenance scripts stay in git. Files stay on disk.
/backtests_research/**
!/backtests_research/**/
!/backtests_research/INDEX.md
!/backtests_research/**/*.md
!/backtests_research/*/universe_*.txt
!/backtests_research/*/pruned_universe.txt
!/backtests_research/**/_provenance/**
